# mtncloud_shell_script_task

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

~> **Known MTN Cloud issue:** MTN Cloud's web firewall refuses some scripts before they reach the API,
and the apply fails with HTTP 403 and a firewall reference. `echo tf-acc` was refused and `uptime`
wasn't (2026-10-31). If a script is refused, send the firewall reference to MTN, or keep the script
in a repository and use `source_type = "repository"`.

